{'symbol': 'NWL', 'date': '2021-10-14 03:08:00', 'title': 'THE CROCKPOT BRAND AUCTIONING FIRST-EVER NFT TO CELEBRATE ITS 50TH ANNIVERSARY', 'text': 'BOCA RATON, FLA., OCT. 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SUNBEAM PRODUCTS, INC., THE MANUFACTURER OF CROCKPOT ("CROCKPOT"),—THE ORIGINAL SLOW COOKER—TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS CREATED ITS FIRST-EVER NON-FUNGIBLE TOKEN (NFT) IN HONOR OF THE 50TH ANNIVERSARY OF THE CROCKPOT BRAND.'}